<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">- Ibaas</book>
  <para style="h">AYuda</para>
  <para style="toc3">AYu</para>
  <para style="toc2">AYuda</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kufumung fɛ́ aYuda Jɛk</para>
  <para style="mt1">AYuda</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kufumung fɛ́ aYuda Jɛk</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1" />Kufumung kang ne ni imi aJuda, asam aYeso Kristi, arunyining aYakubu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JUD 1:1">In jɛk sak ne bayɔng fɛ́ aYeso mi ka ba yes, fɛ́ Adakunom ka ba shim, fɛ́ aYeso tsin ka ba tot bá: <verse eid="JUD 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2" />Won angmishish, ni kusot kukyang ni ishim ni i se ni iyin shɛrɛk.<verse eid="JUD 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikɔrɔk kuto naton bafi <optbreak /> itees mbɔɔs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3" />Bacɛk iyɛ hom, in bi iyɛ ngash in ki jɛk yin kufumung kang naton kutset yɔng fi in sɛ yit na Adakunom. Awɛt, in tin di i se gbing-gbing ni in ki jɛk yin, in ki kɔrɔk yin kuto fok: Nyeseng yin gak, ni tɛnɛng yin atsak yɔng Adakunom mi ki won yit e ni mbɔk yit, banet wu, nkum atsak e yɔng, vit ibarang. <verse eid="JUD 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4" />Nek banet bakak fɛ́ ba ki mang jɛk ikpa bà neme, ba mi nɔɔs ayɛt yin ni nɛt. Ba mi teng ba tirisi itek Adakunom sak ni irèn iras nggɔn nduk. Ba tɛ ba tone fok da aYeso Kristi wu a yet Ada nɛ aTisa yit awo.<verse eid="JUD 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5" />Ngma ni irēn fi i bɛ́ yin nfi nkyɔrɔk nang, imi shim in ki yiring yin ne fok: Adakunom kin sheshek banet wu na aMasat, awɛt ama anɔng, a tɛ wey ne bayɔng fɛ́ ba raba dan nɔɔk atsak.<verse eid="JUD 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6" />Batomaza fɛ́ ba raba dang yit karɔ isonong ízɔk bà, ba wosong kasa bà, Adakunom mi ka ba sak narɔ kahwyining, a ka ba rosom ne anyang ayɛ nɛ ayɛ na ba tot ishɔt Kunom kuratek.<verse eid="JUD 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7" />Ni irèn izining e anɔng, aSodom nɛ aGomora, ni nwɔp fi in ka ba te nate, ba nɔ ayɛt ras irɔs nɛ aduk nggɔn. Ba sɔ izot fi i da tonong izot fi kurong ayɛ na ayɛ bi yet.<verse eid="JUD 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8" />Ni irèn izining e anɔng, bafɛ́ nabos bang beseng nrɔm bà, ba raba igwɔm nɛ ba nyes ncɛɛt ibyɛs sak na igwɔm azanɛn. <verse eid="JUD 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9" />Awɛt aMakyel fɛ́ a yet azining ayɛt bagbat batomaza, ni izen fɛ́ a kin se ni kɔk nanan ne aShetan naton kukom aMusa, da aMakyel kin kpa itsɛɛk aShetan ishɔt awo, tit a kin fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;ATisa da gyɔng mo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JUD 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10" />Ngma na anɔng, banet bang ras ncɛɛt abap naton nkyɔrɔk fi da iba irēn awo, nkum ikyɛng fi nrɔm bà shim de ba rēn, ti inyam fi i se vit kuyiring. Ina nkyɔrɔk e yɔng fi i in ka ba beseng.<verse eid="JUD 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11" />Kawɛy yet kafuu ba! Ba mi kuus irèn aKayinu; ba mi ta i tsi sak itsɛt kurúm ti idun fɛ́ aBalaam kin nye nek a di sɛ itsɔm; ba mi wey ni iba nek idoro nhwyɛ, tɛ banet fɛ́ ba kin dorok nhwyɛ nizen aKora fɛ́ ba kin wey ni iba.<verse eid="JUD 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12" />Banet bang fɛ́ ba sosok na narɔ kuyak amyak yin, kuyak ba nate yin e, yet ikyɛng nsum makiyi, vit nnyim ni ba. Ba yet banek fɛ́ ba ya ni ice bà kyɛk. Ba se tɛ anɔk iza fi kuwun kok iza vit ikpa. Ba se tɛ nakon fɛ́ na tes ica ni izen kutes na awo, tɛ nakon fɛ́ ba mi ngaa ina, na mi kus hwyiri-hwyiri. <verse eid="JUD 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13" />Ba se tɛ itsombos ashi fɛ́ awun fɛsɛm, ba ka tang afurutut inang vit ikikak. Ba se tɛ ádat fɛ́ a teng a kat kpɛɛ, ba mi sak ahwyi awe tsin ka ba tot ayɛ vit igang.<verse eid="JUD 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14" />AEnɔk anet afi kuzam kanakataat ama Adamu, man tak ibes naton kuri banet e bang: &lt;&lt;Di yin, Adakunom wuruk ne banet ajɛrɛ wu kudot bà agup e naton agup e, <verse eid="JUD 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15" />nek ira akaangan ishɔt, nɔng ba da ya ngma bafɛ́ vit atsak ishɔt naton anɛn bà, fɛ́ ba ras ni irèn fɛ́ da Adakunom shim awo, ni ncɛɛt in kpashak e fɛ́ ba cɛɛt naton wu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JUD 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16" />Banet e bang yet bafi ngɔɔt nanu ni itsɛsɛk anɛn; ba nyes nkyɔrɔk anyas fi ishim nrɔm bà fɛ́ ni ba; ba tsosok agwɔm ni ice bà, na ba tsosok bakak nanu rɔtɔt yɔk ba di sɛs kunang.<verse eid="JUD 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itabak ni ikɔrɔk kuto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17" />Awɛt, iyin bafidang hom, yiring yin ni ikyɛng fɛ́ batom aYeso Kristi ki mang tak gyam. <verse eid="JUD 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18" />Ba kin fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Ni nnom igang e, ba bi se banet ncɛɛt nbɔrɔk, fɛ́ ba bi kuus amaan ikɔk nrɔm bà.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JUD 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19" />Kuri banet fɛ́ ba bɛs ni ikam yin yɔng, bayɔng fɛ́ ba nyes ikyɛng fi nrɔm bà fɛ́, ba bɛ́ Kabik Adakunom awo.<verse eid="JUD 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20" />Awɛt, iyin bafidang in, nok yin ace yin ayɛt atsak ajɛrɛ, ni ras yin awon ayɛt agap Kabik aJɛrɛ. <verse eid="JUD 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21" />Sonong yin ayɛt ishim Adakunom, ni tsin di tot yin angmishish aTisa yit aYeso Kristi fɛ́ a da ki tsa yin sak i sɛ kutset vit igang. <verse eid="JUD 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22" />Fok yin angmishish bayɔng fɛ́ ba bɛ ayɛ gak. <verse eid="JUD 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23" />Tenat yin bakak fɛ ba se tɛ ba se ni rong, nɔng i da ka ba sheshek yin mo; Sak na bakak, fok yin angmishish ba, ni moon yin ni nnyim, ni rayin ares bà fɛ́ ba mi gbit ina, ni nrɔm bà fɛ́ in mi beseng ni kujang.<verse eid="JUD 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Awon Igang e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24" />Won itere, ni i sot ifɛ́ ayɔng fɛ́ a bi kukyem i ki bereng yin kɔng i bi kpa yin na ki nabak yin ashon azɔk Adakunom, jɛrɛ vit inɛn, ni iyɛ ikan makiyi. <verse eid="JUD 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25" />Won iratek, ni ízɔk igwɔm, na agap ni kukyem, ni in yet nfɛ́ Adakunom, Anet-Isheshek yit, fi i ne ne aYeso Kristi, aTisa yit, neme dang na ba nye kazatse, i se yɔkɔnɔng ne ayɛ vit igang. Anɔng.<verse eid="JUD 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1" />
</usx>